# THE SHOPIFY CLI HONOURS THIS FILE ON PUSH. That is not obvious and it cost an
# hour: a gitignored snippet is never uploaded, and Liquid renders a MISSING
# snippet as empty with no error at all, so the page looks fine and the feature
# silently does not exist. Anything the theme needs at runtime must be un-ignored
# here, not just committed.
# The pulled stock theme is Shopify's, not mine, and 190 files of it would bury
# the two files that are. Only my additions and the perf work are tracked.
assets/*
!assets/sim-tagmgr.js
!assets/sim-chat.js
!assets/sim-reviews.js
config/
locales/
templates/*
!templates/product.json
sections/*
!sections/product-spec-table.liquid
!sections/main-product.liquid
snippets/*
!snippets/seo-breadcrumb-jsonld.liquid
!snippets/spec-value.liquid
!snippets/third-party-sim.liquid
layout/
node_modules/
.shopify/
